WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.281
Rapunzel gasped. "Oh no, Prince!

2
00:00:07.282 --> 00:00:08.815
The witch is back.

3
00:00:08.816 --> 00:00:14.236
You must hide! Quickly!"

4
00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:19.537
The prince crawled under the bed.

5
00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:25.058
Rapunzel let down her hair.

6
00:00:25.059 --> 00:00:31.518
The witch climbed up.

7
00:00:31.519 --> 00:00:35.076
"Is something wrong, Witch?" Rapunzel asked.

8
00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:37.786
"Did you forget something?"

9
00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.188
The witch did not answer.

10
00:00:40.189 --> 00:00:43.038
She looked around the room.

11
00:00:43.039 --> 00:00:49.011
Then she marched over to the bed. "Aha!"

12
00:00:49.012 --> 00:00:53.772
The witch dragged the prince out.

13
00:00:53.773 --> 00:00:57.834
"I knew someone was visiting you, Rapunzel!

14
00:00:57.835 --> 00:01:02.129
You broke your promise again!"

15
00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:06.223
The old woman pointed a finger at the prince.

16
00:01:06.224 --> 00:01:11.209
She mumbled some magic words.

17
00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.835
Then . . . zap!

18
00:01:13.836 --> 00:01:17.099
A spell blasted from her finger.

19
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:23.166
The spell shot the prince far into the forest!

20
00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:28.345
Rapunzel screamed. "Where did he go?

21
00:01:28.346 --> 00:01:33.314
Is he hurt? Bring him back!"

22
00:01:33.315 --> 00:01:37.085
"Never!" the witch cried.

23
00:01:37.086 --> 00:01:39.698
"You disobeyed me!

24
00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:43.436
I will never let you go now.

25
00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:49.202
You will stay locked in this tower forever!"

26
00:01:49.203 --> 00:01:52.023
"No!" Rapunzel cried.

27
00:01:52.024 --> 00:01:54.479
"I am almost 18.

28
00:01:54.480 --> 00:02:00.085
You said you would let me go home."

29
00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:04.282
The witch laughed. "Silly goose!

30
00:02:04.283 --> 00:02:08.324
I was never going to set you free.

31
00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:12.794
You will stay here forever.

32
00:02:12.795 --> 00:02:18.269
And no one will ever visit you again!"

33
00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.959
The witch reached into her basket.

34
00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:26.463
She pulled out a large pair of scissors.

35
00:02:26.464 --> 00:02:28.791
Snip, snip!

36
00:02:28.792 --> 00:02:33.031
She cut off Rapunzel's long hair!

37
00:02:33.032 --> 00:02:40.115
The witch tied Rapunzel's braid to the window.

38
00:02:40.116 --> 00:02:46.604
Then she climbed down.

39
00:02:46.605 --> 00:02:48.924
Rapunzel reached for the braid.

40
00:02:48.925 --> 00:02:53.520
She started to pull up the hair again.

41
00:02:53.521 --> 00:02:56.851
"Drop that!" the witch yelled.

42
00:02:56.852 --> 00:03:00.530
She pointed at Rapunzel.

43
00:03:00.531 --> 00:03:03.572
Something stung Rapunzel's hand.

44
00:03:03.573 --> 00:03:07.047
"Ouch!" Rapunzel cried, letting go.

45
00:03:07.048 --> 00:03:10.964
The long rope of hair fell to the ground.

46
00:03:10.965 --> 00:03:15.483
It lay in a heap at the bottom of the tower.

47
00:03:15.484 --> 00:03:19.236
"Ha!" The witch croaked.

48
00:03:19.237 --> 00:03:26.008
"Now you can never escape!"

